From: Super User <root@localhost.localdomain>
Date: Sat, 9 May 2026 01:48:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] KVM: arm64: HDBSS v4 implementation

- Simple fixes (HDBSSBR_EL2 define, size->order)
- Add dirty_bit.c for HDBSS code
- DBM bug fixes (kvm_pgtable_stage2_pte_prot, stage2_pte_needs_update)
- Auto enable/disable HDBSS during migration
- Enable eager hugepage splitting when HDBSS available
